    "name": "SSLCommerz Recurring Subscription Manual Ops",
    "description": "Manual operations for SSLCommerz recurring subscriptions. Use these to check status and stop problematic subscriptions that are not recorded in local DB.\n\nImportant: SSLCommerz recurring docs and backend gateway implementation support cancel (permanent), disable (temporary), enable, and status query actions. There is no documented delete action for subscriptions.",
